    <div style="background: #F7F3EC; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #C9A24B;">
      <h3 style="color: #1B2A4A; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">📖 What is Halqatul Qur'anil Karim?</h3>
      <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.7;">Halqatul Qur'anil Karim is a Qur'anic and Islamic school located in Sabon Garin Kudan, Kaduna State, Nigeria. We focus on Qur'anic memorization and Islamic knowledge including Hadith, Fiqh, Seerah, and Arabic.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F7F3EC; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #1E5631;">
      <h3 style="color: #1B2A4A; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">👦 What ages do you accept?</h3>
      <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.7;">We accept children from age 5 and above. We have programs for primary, junior secondary, senior secondary, and a full-time Hifz program.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F7F3EC; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #C9A24B;">
      <h3 style="color: #1B2A4A; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">🕌 What subjects do you teach?</h3>
      <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.7;">We teach:</p>
      <ul style="color: #555; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        <li>Qur'anic Memorization (Hifz) with Tajweed</li>
        <li>Hadith (Prophetic traditions)</li>
        <li>Fiqh (Islamic jurisprudence)</li>
        <li>Seerah (Life of Prophet Muhammad ﷺ)</li>
        <li>Arabic Language</li>
        <li>Islamic Studies</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F7F3EC; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #1E5631;">
      <h3 style="color: #1B2A4A; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">💰 How much are the school fees?</h3>
      <p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.7;">Our fees are affordable with flexible payment plans available. We also offer sibling discounts and scholarships for deserving students. Please contact us for current fee details.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F7F3EC; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #C9A24B;">
